WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:07.540
Part six: move, hand off, and remove. Change who's working where on a Hub game, right from the roster.

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:10.076
Tap Move next to a person.

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:14.586
Pick the new position. Only positions with an open spot can be picked.

00:00:14.786 --> 00:00:17.667
Show other Hub games lists spots at other games too.

00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:21.160
Tap Move. They get an email with their new spot.

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:24.699
Hand off gives a person's spot to someone else.

00:00:24.899 --> 00:00:26.883
Search for, and pick, who gets it.

00:00:27.083 --> 00:00:29.004
Pick the credit for the new person.

00:00:29.204 --> 00:00:36.700
Tap Hand off. As an admin, it happens right away. Nobody has to accept, and both people get an email.

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:42.841
Remove takes someone off. It counts as excused, unless you tick Count as a late drop.

00:00:43.041 --> 00:00:45.687
Your note goes in the log, and in their email.

00:00:45.887 --> 00:00:47.650
Tap Remove.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:50.591
The roster reloads with the change.

00:00:50.791 --> 00:01:00.740
Here, SE Concessions No Permit is now two of three. If someone's waiting for a spot, the first person who still qualifies moves up automatically.
